Opechancanough (; 1554–1646) was the main chief of the Powhatan People. He followed his older brother Powhatan. He captured Captain John Smith. Opechancanough led the Powhatans in the Second and Third Anglo-Powhatan Wars. His tactics were not that diplomactic. He was captured and killed by the British in 1646. His name means "He whose Soul is White". Nectowance replaced Opechancanough as chief of the Powhatan.
= = = Change (In the House of Flies) = = =
"Change (In the House of Flies)" is a 2000 song by American alternative metal band Deftones and is the leading single from the their third album White Pony. It remains their most successful single to this day.
