Angela died on 13 August 2022 in Cagliari, Italy at the age of 93.
= = = Denise Dowse = = =
Denise Yvonne Dowse (February 21, 1958 – August 13, 2022) was an American actress. She is best known for her roles as Mrs. Yvonne Teasley in the Fox teen drama television series "Beverly Hills, 90210", Judge Rebecca Damsen in the CBS drama series "The Guardian", and Dr. Rhonda Pine in the HBO comedy-drama television series "Insecure".
On August 5, 2022, Dowse was hospitalized for meningitis and she later fell into a coma. She died on August 13, 2022, at the age of 64.
= = = International Chemistry Olympiad = = =
The International Chemistry Olympiad (IChO) is a chemistry-themed International Olympiad. The first IChO was held in 1968. It has gradually expanded to over 80 countries from all continents. The competition takes place each year organized by a different host country observing the regulations and traditions of the IChO.
The IChO is intended to stimulate the activities of students interested in chemistry by a way of the independent and creative solution of chemical problems. It encourages cooperation and international understanding.
= = = Baddiewinkle = = =
