= = = The God Delusion = = =
The God Delusion is a 2006 book by Richard Dawkins.
= = = Athletics at the 1934 Women's World Games = = =
The athletics competitions at the 1934 Women's World Games in London were held from 9 to 11 August 1934 at the White City Stadium.
The track and field athletes competed in 12 events: running (60 metres, 100 metres, 200 metres, 800 metres, 4 x 100 metres relay and hurdling 80 metres), high jump, long jump, discus throw, javelin, shot put and pentathlon (100 metres, high jump, long jump, javelin and shot put).
It was the first time the Women’s World Games included the women's pentathlon. This was in stead of the triathlon event of 1930.
