= = = Enough (movie) = = =
Enough is a 2002 American thriller movie directed by Michael Apted. The movie is based on the 1998 novel "Black and Blue", by Anna Quindlen, which was a "New York Times" bestseller.
It stars Jennifer Lopez as Slim, an abused wife who learns to fight back. "Enough" got negative reviews from critics on its release. Although it is now often cited as an underrated thriller.
