= = = Rogier Stoffers = = =
Rogier Stoffers, ASC (born 9 November 1961) is a Dutch cinematographer. He is known for his works in movies and television, shooting movies like "Quills", "John Q.", "School of Rock", and "Disturbia". He has been nominated for a Primetime Emmy Award and an ASC Award. He is the recipient of a Golden Frog award from the prestigious Camerimage Film Festival.
